# Layer A density v5 fixture (Q-060 M-4 slice b): opt-in `@auto`
# effect synthesis on the file-write shape. The `@auto` marker in the
# effect-instances slot (here in the typeArguments position — the
# tail-collapse spelling) directs the Elaborator to synthesize the
# EffectDecl list from fsWrite's declared writeFx and its Q-039
# ArgRef(0) projection. Round-trip hash equals fs-write-auto-explicit's.
@v=1 root=w
p STR "/safe/log"
d BYT "64617461"
w APP fsWrite [p d] @auto
